  "_note": "Level 1-2 beats 1 to 4 (LVL-02b) from design/levels/LEVEL-1-2.md: the open service corridor with the empty B02 plinth, the parry corridor (one Roamer alone, its own one wave arena), the yard, the Ring arena (A2: two waves of Roamers, the north exit a reveal) and the breather store with a window onto the ring and the level's exit pad for now. Beats 5 to 9 (the tower, Arena 2, the gauntlet) come with a later card. The path runs north: the player starts in the south corridor at y 0 and walks to -z. One floor, one ceiling and a perimeter wall enclose the level; the rooms are the open spaces between walls and the pinches between them are the arena doors. The B02 rack is [Paul] (B02 is not built): the plinth stands empty with a foam-yellow marking. Names, setting and the accent colour are [Paul]. Metres, Y up, positions are box centres, sizes are full extents. Tuning numbers (wave gaps and holds) live here, not in code.",
